      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "We hope to see you on our second evening of the Alianait Arts Festival! We will be presenting some mega power house singers that will be sure to take your breath away. Starting with last year's Nunavut's Got Talent winners Mandi B and Band, then Sam Lynch armed with guitar and stunning voice. Celeig"
      }
